+curator hybrid add <name> [options]
+```
+
+Options:
+
+- `--branch string`: git branch.
+- `--git string`: git clone URL.
+- `--revision string`: git revision.
+- `--tag string`: git tag.
+- `--target string`: target alias, absolute path, or glob.
